internal/jevtok ports the offline Jev 1.13 counter from
crates/pi-natives/src/utok/{jev.rs,bpe.rs,pretoken.rs,scan/qwen.rs,scan/mod.rs}
and embeds the measured rank tables jev_base.bin.zst and jev_whole.bin.zst
(data/README.md: recovered from live usage.input_tokens, 2026-09-23, not a
published tokenizer). The checked-in .bin.gz files are those UTOK1 payloads
recompressed with gzip; genblob.go records the fetch and the hashes.

